DWT STATUS

DEFRA guidance updated 18 Sep confirms receipt public beta has
operated since 28 Apr 2026 and mandatory receiver reporting begins Oct
2026 England/Wales and Jan 2027 Scotland/NI. Phase 2
collectors/carriers/brokers/dealers targets private beta autumn 2026,
public beta spring 2027 and mandatory use Oct 2027. The 23 Jul Alpha
assessment (published 4 Aug) confirms OpenAPI and permission to
proceed to private beta subject to spend control. CONFIRMED.

DEFRA's 14 Sep software-provider guidance further confirms
production-approved software must integrate with the Receipt API and
pass 14 production approval scenarios. CONFIRMED.

